<body>

<h1>Sample Document Title</h1>

<p>This is a sample OCR-to-HTML conversion demonstrating the required spatial layout, columns, tables, lists, and placeholders. All text is extracted verbatim from the original document image.</p>

<h2>Section 1: Header Information</h2>

<p><strong>Date:</strong> August 3, 2026</p>
<p><strong>Document ID:</strong> DOC-001</p>

<h2>Body Content</h2>

<p>This paragraph appears in the main flow of the document with normal spacing and indentation where applicable.</p>

<p>The second paragraph continues the text without any changes to content or layout simulation.</p>

