<p>The quadratic equation is given by:</p>

$$ ax^2 + bx + c = 0 $$

<p>Where $a$, $b$, and $c$ are coefficients.</p>

<p>Inline math: $E = mc^2$.</p>

<h2>Placeholder for Non-Text Element</h2>

<div class="placeholder" style="width: 400px; height: 200px; margin: 20px auto;" data-caption="[Chart: centered at bottom]">
    [Chart: centered]
</div>

<p>Image or diagram placeholder placed exactly where it appears in the original layout.</p>

<h2>Centered and Right-Aligned Text</h2>

<div class="centered">
    <p>This text is centered as in the original document.</p>
</div>

<div class="right">
    <p>This text is right-aligned.</p>
</div>

<h2>Section with Indentation</h2>

<p style="margin-left: 30px;">Indented paragraph simulating the original physical layout.</p>

